   "col": "left",
   "items": [
    "Lambda polls Kinesis via ESM; producer calling Lambda is a distractor.",
    "Function SQS DLQ is for async only; use ESM on-failure dest for streams.",
    "Concurrency = shards × ParallelizationFactor; low reserved concurrency throttles.",
    "Order is per shard (per partition key if ParallelizationFactor > 1); timeout won't fix poison pills."
   ],
